#. type: TH
#: en/minios-configurator.1:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "MiniOS Configurator"
msgstr "Konfigurator MiniOS"

#. type: TH
#: en/minios-configurator.1:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "User Commands"
msgstr "Perintah Pengguna"

#. type: SH
#: en/minios-configurator.1:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "NAME"
msgstr "NAMA"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-configurator.1:4
msgid "minios-configurator - Configure MiniOS system settings"
msgstr "minios-configurator - Mengonfigurasi pengaturan sistem MiniOS"

#. type: SH
#: en/minios-configurator.1:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "SYNOPSIS"
msgstr "SINOPSIS"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-configurator.1:9
msgid ""
"B<minios-configurator> [I<--help>] [I<--inherit-cmdline>] [I<config-file>]"
msgstr ""
"B<minios-configurator> [I<--help>] [I<--inherit-cmdline>] [I<config-file>]"

#. type: SH
#: en/minios-configurator.1:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "DESKRIPSI"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-configurator.1:12
msgid ""
"B<minios-configurator> is a GTK3 graphical utility for configuring MiniOS "
"system settings. It provides an interface for modifying live-config "
"parameters that control system behavior."
msgstr ""
"B<minios-configurator> adalah utilitas grafis GTK3 untuk mengonfigurasi "
"pengaturan sistem MiniOS. Aplikasi ini menyediakan antarmuka untuk mengubah "
"parameter live-config yang mengendalikan perilaku sistem."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-configurator.1:16
msgid ""
"Reads and writes configuration files in live-config format, typically at I</"
"etc/live/config.conf> with validation and auto-completion."
msgstr ""
"Membaca dan menulis berkas konfigurasi dalam format live-config, biasanya di "
"I</etc/live/config.conf> dengan validasi dan pelengkapan otomatis."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-configurator.1:22
msgid ""
"Categories are directly selectable; this application is not a wizard. A "
"fixed action bar reports unsaved changes and provides Discard changes, "
"Review changes, and Save changes. Discarding requires confirmation.  Review "
"output redacts passwords. Saved settings are applied by live-config on the "
"next boot."
msgstr ""
"Kategori dapat dipilih secara langsung; aplikasi ini bukan wizard. Bilah "
"aksi tetap menampilkan perubahan yang belum disimpan dan menyediakan opsi "
"Buang perubahan, Tinjau perubahan, dan Simpan perubahan. Pembuangan "
"perubahan memerlukan konfirmasi. Hasil tinjauan menyembunyikan sandi. "
"Pengaturan yang disimpan akan diterapkan oleh live-config saat boot "
"berikutnya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-configurator.1:24
msgid "Requires administrative privileges via PolicyKit authentication."
msgstr "Memerlukan hak administratif melalui autentikasi PolicyKit."

#. type: SH
#: en/minios-configurator.1:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "OPTIONS"
msgstr "OPSI"

#. type: TP
#: en/minios-configurator.1:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-h, --help>"
msgstr "B<-h, --help>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-configurator.1:28
msgid "Show a short usage message and exit."
msgstr "Tampilkan pesan penggunaan singkat dan keluar."

#. type: TP
#: en/minios-configurator.1:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-i, --inherit-cmdline>"
msgstr "B<-i, --inherit-cmdline>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-configurator.1:32
msgid ""
"Overlay supported values from /proc/cmdline. The alternate configuration "
"path remains the persistence target."
msgstr ""
"Menimpa nilai yang didukung dari /proc/cmdline. Jalur konfigurasi alternatif "
"tetap menjadi target persistensi."

#. type: TP
#: en/minios-configurator.1:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "I<config-file>"
msgstr "I<config-file>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-configurator.1:36
msgid ""
"Use an alternate live-config file instead of the default I</etc/live/"
"config.conf>."
msgstr ""
"Gunakan berkas live-config alternatif sebagai pengganti I</etc/live/"
"config.conf> default."

#. type: SH
#: en/minios-configurator.1:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "CONFIGURATION"
msgstr "KONFIGURASI"

#. type: TP
#: en/minios-configurator.1:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<User>"
msgstr "B<Pengguna>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-configurator.1:41
msgid ""
"Username, full name, supplementary groups, encrypted user and root "
"passwords, and media-backed user-directory link or bind mode."
msgstr ""
"Nama pengguna, nama lengkap, grup tambahan, sandi pengguna dan root "
"terenkripsi, serta mode tautan atau bind direktori pengguna yang didukung "
"media."

#. type: TP
#: en/minios-configurator.1:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<System>"
msgstr "B<Sistem>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-configurator.1:45
msgid ""
"No-root mode, hostname, locales, timezone, boot target, and systemd units or "
"SysV services to enable or disable."
msgstr ""
"Mode tanpa root, hostname, locale, zona waktu, target boot, serta unit "
"systemd atau layanan SysV yang akan diaktifkan atau dinonaktifkan."

#. type: TP
#: en/minios-configurator.1:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<Security>"
msgstr "B<Keamanan>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-configurator.1:50
msgid ""
"Security profiles and editable sudo, PolicyKit, OpenSSH, XRDP, X11, password "
"hint, and screen-lock posture controls. Profile names are not saved as "
"runtime configuration keys."
msgstr ""
"Profil keamanan serta kontrol sudo, PolicyKit, OpenSSH, XRDP, X11, petunjuk "
"sandi, dan penguncian layar yang dapat diedit. Nama profil tidak disimpan "
"sebagai kunci konfigurasi runtime."

#. type: TP
#: en/minios-configurator.1:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<Keyboard>"
msgstr "B<Papan Ketik>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-configurator.1:53
msgid "Model, layouts, variants, and options."
msgstr "Model, tata letak, varian, dan opsi."

#. type: TP
#: en/minios-configurator.1:53
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<Advanced>"
msgstr "B<Lanjutan>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-configurator.1:57
msgid ""
"Module mode, additional live-config command line, debug output, and boot-log "
"export."
msgstr ""
"Mode modul, baris perintah live-config tambahan, keluaran debug, dan ekspor "
"log boot."

#. type: SH
#: en/minios-configurator.1:57
#, no-wrap
msgid "VALUES"
msgstr "NILAI"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-configurator.1:61
msgid ""
"B<DEFAULT_TARGET> accepts graphical.target, multi-user.target, and "
"rescue.target. Short graphical, multi-user, and rescue aliases are "
"normalized."
msgstr ""
"B<DEFAULT_TARGET> menerima graphical.target, multi-user.target, dan "
"rescue.target. Alias singkat graphical, multi-user, dan rescue akan "
"dinormalisasi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-configurator.1:66
msgid ""
"B<LIVE_MODULE_MODE> accepts simple or merged. Sudo and PolicyKit modes "
"accept passwordless, password, or disabled. XRDP accepts relaxed, hardened, "
"or disabled. X11 and screen-lock modes accept relaxed or hardened. Boolean "
"fields accept true or false."
msgstr ""
"B<LIVE_MODULE_MODE> menerima simple atau merged. Mode Sudo dan PolicyKit "
"menerima passwordless, password, atau disabled. XRDP menerima relaxed, "
"hardened, atau disabled. Mode X11 dan penguncian layar menerima relaxed atau "
"hardened. Field boolean menerima true atau false."

#. type: SH
#: en/minios-configurator.1:66
#, no-wrap
msgid "VALIDATION"
msgstr "VALIDASI"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-configurator.1:72
msgid ""
"The application validates host and user names, installed UTF-8 locales, "
"timezones, keyboard values, systemd units and SysV scripts, conflicting "
"service lists, and cross-field security rules. User-directory link and bind "
"modes are mutually exclusive and require a safe path inside writable MiniOS "
"media."
msgstr ""
"Aplikasi memvalidasi nama host dan pengguna, locale UTF-8 yang terpasang, "
"zona waktu, nilai papan ketik, unit systemd dan skrip SysV, daftar layanan "
"yang bertentangan, serta aturan keamanan antar field. Mode tautan dan bind "
"direktori pengguna bersifat eksklusif dan memerlukan jalur aman di dalam "
"media MiniOS yang dapat ditulis."

#. type: SH
#: en/minios-configurator.1:72
#, no-wrap
msgid "APPLICABILITY"
msgstr "KEBERLAKUAN"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-configurator.1:77
msgid ""
"Hostname, locale, timezone, services, keyboard, boot controls, user-media, "
"and log export apply after reboot. Account creation, passwords, no-root "
"mode, and security posture are one-shot settings used only when a new "
"session is created."
msgstr ""
"Hostname, locale, zona waktu, layanan, papan ketik, kontrol boot, user-"
"media, dan ekspor log berlaku setelah reboot. Pembuatan akun, sandi, mode "
"tanpa root, dan postur keamanan adalah pengaturan satu kali yang hanya "
"digunakan saat sesi baru dibuat."

#. type: SH
#: en/minios-configurator.1:77
#, no-wrap
msgid "FILES"
msgstr "BERKAS"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-configurator.1:79
msgid "I</etc/live/config.conf>"
msgstr "I</etc/live/config.conf>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-configurator.1:81
msgid "I</usr/share/applications/minios-configurator.desktop>"
msgstr "I</usr/share/applications/minios-configurator.desktop>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-configurator.1:83
msgid "I</usr/share/polkit-1/actions/org.minios.configurator.policy>"
msgstr "I</usr/share/polkit-1/actions/org.minios.configurator.policy>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-configurator.1:85
msgid "I</usr/lib/minios-configurator/>"
msgstr "I</usr/lib/minios-configurator/>"

#. type: SH
#: en/minios-configurator.1:85
#, no-wrap
msgid "NOTES"
msgstr "CATATAN"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-configurator.1:91
msgid ""
"Only explicitly changed fields are saved. Atomic replacement preserves "
"comments, ordering, unknown keys, ownership, permissions, and extended "
"attributes. Symlink and non-regular configuration files are rejected. The "
"configurator does not mutate the running system."
msgstr ""
"Hanya bidang yang diubah secara eksplisit yang akan disimpan. Penggantian "
"atomik mempertahankan komentar, urutan, kunci yang tidak dikenal, "
"kepemilikan, izin akses, dan atribut tambahan. Berkas konfigurasi symlink "
"dan non-reguler akan ditolak. Konfigurator tidak mengubah sistem yang sedang "
"berjalan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-configurator.1:93
msgid ""
"Passwords are redacted during review and saved only as encrypted values."
msgstr ""
"Kata sandi akan disamarkan saat ditinjau dan hanya disimpan dalam bentuk "
"terenkripsi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-configurator.1:100
msgid ""
"Persistence parameters perchmode, perchencrypt, and perchsize are not "
"configuration fields. For a boot request using perchencrypt=luks, the "
"application only reports whether the runtime capability marker contains luks-"
"layer-v1 at I</run/initramfs/etc/minios-initramfs-crypt>; it never creates, "
"opens, resizes, or unlocks a container."
msgstr ""
"Parameter persistensi perchmode, perchencrypt, dan perchsize bukan merupakan "
"bidang konfigurasi. Untuk permintaan boot dengan perchencrypt=luks, aplikasi "
"hanya melaporkan apakah penanda kapabilitas runtime berisi luks-layer-v1 "
"pada I</run/initramfs/etc/minios-initramfs-crypt>; aplikasi tidak pernah "
"membuat, membuka, mengubah ukuran, atau membuka kunci kontainer."

#. type: SH
#: en/minios-configurator.1:100
#, no-wrap
msgid "AUTHOR"
msgstr "PENULIS"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-configurator.1:102
msgid "crims0n E<lt>crims0n@minios.devE<gt>"
msgstr "crims0n E<lt>crims0n@minios.devE<gt>"

